TITL YbMgGaO4_c1_p3_RO_rrp in R-3m
REM R-3m (#166 in standard setting)
CELL 0.41114   3.391775   3.391775  25.015506  90.0000  90.0000 120.0000
ZERR    2.00   0.000093   0.000093   0.000574   0.0000   0.0000   0.0000
LATT  3
SYMM -y, x-y, z
SYMM -x+y,-x, z
SYMM  y, x,-z
SYMM  x-y,-y,-z
SYMM -x,-x+y,-z
SFAC O Mg Ga Yb
UNIT 8.00 2.00 2.00 2.00
TREF
HKLF 4
END
